{"id":"3d27136d-d08f-4ad2-8514-954e904688f6","zed":"context","version":"0.4.0","text":"\n\n\n```html next-bound-frontend/src/app/shared/components/navbar/navbar.component.html\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <p-menubar [model]=\"items\">\n    <ng-template pTemplate=\"start\">\n      <img src=\"nbicon.png\" style=\"height: 30px; width: 30px\" />\n    </ng-template>\n    <ng-template pTemplate=\"item\" let-item let-root=\"root\">\n      <a pRipple class=\"flex align-items-center p-menuitem-link\">\n        <span [class]=\"item.icon\"></span>\n        <span class=\"ml-2\">{{ item.label }}</span>\n        <p-badge\n          *ngIf=\"item.badge\"\n          [ngClass]=\"{ 'ml-auto': !root, 'ml-2': root }\"\n          [value]=\"item.badge\"\n        />\n        <span\n          *ngIf=\"item.shortcut\"\n          class=\"ml-auto border-1 surface-border border-round surface-100 text-xs p-1\"\n          >{{ item.shortcut }}</span\n        >\n        <i\n          *ngIf=\"item.items\"\n          [ngClass]=\"[\n            'pi',\n            root ? 'pi-angle-down ml-2' : 'pi-angle-right ml-auto',\n          ]\"\n        ></i>\n      </a>\n    </ng-template>\n    <ng-template pTemplate=\"end\">\n      <div class=\"flex align-items-center gap-2\">\n        <input\n          type=\"text\"\n          pInputText\n          placeholder=\"Search\"\n          class=\"w-8rem sm:w-auto\"\n        />\n        <p-avatar\n          image=\"https://primefaces.org/cdn/primeng/images/demo/avatar/amyelsner.png\"\n          shape=\"circle\"\n        />\n      </div>\n    </ng-template>\n  </p-menubar>\n</div>\n```\n\nNecesito que os items se distribuyan space-between, usa primeflex para ello.\nPara distribuir los elementos del `p-menubar` utilizando `space-between` con PrimeFlex, puedes agregar las clases de PrimeFlex adecuadas a los elementos contenedores. Aquí tienes cómo puedes modificar tu código HTML para lograr esto:\n\n```html\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <p-menubar [model]=\"items\" class=\"flex justify-content-between\">\n    <ng-template pTemplate=\"start\">\n      <img src=\"nbicon.png\" style=\"height: 30px; width: 30px\" />\n    </ng-template>\n    <ng-template pTemplate=\"item\" let-item let-root=\"root\">\n      <a pRipple class=\"flex align-items-center p-menuitem-link\">\n        <span [class]=\"item.icon\"></span>\n        <span class=\"ml-2\">{{ item.label }}</span>\n        <p-badge\n          *ngIf=\"item.badge\"\n          [ngClass]=\"{ 'ml-auto': !root, 'ml-2': root }\"\n          [value]=\"item.badge\"\n        />\n        <span\n          *ngIf=\"item.shortcut\"\n          class=\"ml-auto border-1 surface-border border-round surface-100 text-xs p-1\"\n          >{{ item.shortcut }}</span\n        >\n        <i\n          *ngIf=\"item.items\"\n          [ngClass]=\"[\n            'pi',\n            root ? 'pi-angle-down ml-2' : 'pi-angle-right ml-auto',\n          ]\"\n        ></i>\n      </a>\n    </ng-template>\n    <ng-template pTemplate=\"end\">\n      <div class=\"flex align-items-center gap-2\">\n        <input\n          type=\"text\"\n          pInputText\n          placeholder=\"Search\"\n          class=\"w-8rem sm:w-auto\"\n        />\n        <p-avatar\n          image=\"https://primefaces.org/cdn/primeng/images/demo/avatar/amyelsner.png\"\n          shape=\"circle\"\n        />\n      </div>\n    </ng-template>\n  </p-menubar>\n</div>\n```\n\nEn este código, he añadido la clase `flex justify-content-between` al `p-menubar` para que los elementos hijos se distribuyan con `space-between`. Esto debería distribuir los elementos de manera uniforme a lo largo del contenedor del menú.\n","messages":[{"id":{"replica_id":0,"value":0},"start":0,"metadata":{"role":"user","status":"Done","timestamp":{"replica_id":0,"value":46}}},{"id":{"replica_id":0,"value":40},"start":1500,"metadata":{"role":"assistant","status":"Done","timestamp":{"replica_id":0,"value":47}}},{"id":{"replica_id":0,"value":41},"start":3364,"metadata":{"role":"user","status":"Done","timestamp":{"replica_id":0,"value":48}}}],"summary":"Distribute Navbar Items Evenly","slash_command_output_sections":[{"range":{"start":0,"end":1},"icon":"Library","label":"Default","metadata":null},{"range":{"start":3,"end":1422},"icon":"File","label":"next-bound-frontend/src/app/shared/components/navbar/navbar.component.html","metadata":{"path":"next-bound-frontend/src/app/shared/components/navbar/navbar.component.html"}}]}